7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I want to review the house chat logs. I need to understand how our conflicts actually start before we lock in a year-long system.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to check the bathroom spray receipts and the management office rate sheet. I need to know exactly what this costs us every month!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m a bit nervous about picking, but I think I should look at what counts as done and the grout. I just want to know what to expect.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll also check the outside firm’s terms. I need to know if paying them actually removes the time burden or just shifts it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,I’ll also check the kitchen watch. I need to see who actually uses it versus who cleans it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I’ll also look at the previous tenants’ note. I need to see if their permanent split actually worked, or if it just broke them.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I’ll also check the stopwatch timing! I want to see exactly how long a full clean takes so I can figure out the real monthly cost.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
